  "problem": "Let $f(x)=a\\sqrt{2x+b}+c.$ Now consider the following properties of$f(x):$\n\n- The domain of $f(x)$ is $x\\in [4,\\infty ).$\n\n- The range is $f(x)\\in [-1,\\infty ).$\n\n- The point $(6,3)$ lies on the graph of $y=f(x).$\n\nTherefore, our function is\n$f(x)=$\n{{field-1}}.",
